# Commit author

When committing or pushing:

- **Author is Dewashish Hatekar** (`dewashishhatekar@resiliencesoft.com`).
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by` (or `Signed-off-by`, `Generated-by`, "Made with") for Cursor, Claude, Composer, Copilot, Auto, or any AI/agent.
- If a trailer is required, use only:

  `Co-authored-by: Dewashish Hatekar <dewashishhatekar@resiliencesoft.com>`

- Do not run `git config` to change `user.name` / `user.email`.
- Strip AI co-author trailers from commit messages before `git commit`.
